msgid ""
"If you want to paste some code into your terminal window, the auto-indent "
"feature will mess things up. For example, if you had the following Python "
"code: ::"
msgstr "如果你想把一些程式碼貼到終端機視窗中，自動縮排功能會把事情搞亂。例如，假設你有以下的 Python 程式碼： ::"

#: ../../reference/repl.rst:127
msgid ""
"and you try to paste this into the normal REPL, then you will see something "
"like this:"
msgstr "而你嘗試把它貼到一般的 REPL 中，那麼你會看到類似這樣的內容："

#: ../../reference/repl.rst:139
msgid ""
"If you press Ctrl-E, then you will enter paste mode, which essentially turns"
" off the auto-indent feature, and changes the prompt from ``>>>`` to "
